 generated from the jpackage app image by `scripts/generate_rpm_spec.py`, which reads the cleanup body from the shared `scripts/uninstall-cleanup.sh` instead of duplicating it, and installs the same layout as the AUR package (`/opt/vivi-music-de`, `/usr/bin/vivi-music-de`, `vivi-music-de.desktop`, hicolor icon) with `Vendor: PiBOH` and `License: GPL-3.0-or-later`. Dependencies are left to `rpmbuild`'s automatic soname detection, so nothing hard-codes Fedora-only package names.\n\n### Commits\n- v6.0.6.5_DE-1.52.7-alpha: native Fedora RPM package\n---\nThis release was built automatically from commit `341c151529da96396771bf0819189c08b550fc7d`.\n"},{"tag_name":"6.0.6.5_DE-1.52.6-alpha","name":"Vivi Music 6.0.6.5_DE 1.52.6","published_at":"2026-09-20T17:57:49Z","prerelease":true,"draft":false,"html_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/tag/6.0.6.5_DE-1.52.6-alpha","assets":[{"name":"innosetup.log","size":49091,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.5_DE-1.52.6-alpha/innosetup.log"},{"name":"INSTALL-GUIDE.md","size":9247,"download_count":3,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.5_DE-1.52.6-alpha/INSTALL-GUIDE.md"},{"name":"PKGBUILD","size":1751,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.5_DE-1.52.6-alpha/PKGBUILD"},{"name":"SRCINFO","size":618,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.5_DE-1.52.6-alpha/SRCINFO"},{"name":"vivi-music-de.install","size":943,"download_count":3,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.5_DE-1.52.6-alpha/vivi-music-de.install"},{"name":"VIVIMusic-6.0.6.5_DE-1.52.6-arm64.dmg","size":153136424,"download_count":3,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.5_DE-1.52.6-alpha/VIVIMusic-6.0.6.5_DE-1.52.6-arm6