tifact's internal root itself (the common ancestor of the uploaded paths), so a single-file upload is not guaranteed to land there. The job now locates the two files wherever they landed and flattens them before publishing, and the presence check moved to that step, so a genuinely missing APK still aborts the run instead of publishing a partial build.\n\n### Commits\n- v6.0.6.5_DE-1.52.6-alpha: make the APK publish step find the downloaded files\n- v6.0.6.5_DE-1.52.5-alpha: lyrics options reach every style, playback churn and resize stutter fixed\n- fix(apk): drop the orphan SimpMusic lyrics provider that broke the Kotlin build\n- fix(apk): consolidate the Azerbaijani resources so the Android build compiles again\n---\nThis release was built automatically from commit `60d68b83970ad64228f209c1f920628163b2736e`.\n"},{"tag_name":"6.0.6.4_DE-1.52.4-alpha","name":"Vivi Music 6.0.6.4_DE 1.52.4","published_at":"2026-09-20T16:23:59Z","prerelease":true,"draft":false,"html_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/tag/6.0.6.4_DE-1.52.4-alpha","assets":[{"name":"innosetup.log","size":49092,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.4_DE-1.52.4-alpha/innosetup.log"},{"name":"INSTALL-GUIDE.md","size":9247,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.4_DE-1.52.4-alpha/INSTALL-GUIDE.md"},{"name":"PKGBUILD","size":1751,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.4_DE-1.52.4-alpha/PKGBUILD"},{"name":"SRCINFO","size":618,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.4_DE-1.52.4-alpha/SRCINFO"},{"name":"vivi-music-de.install","size":943,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.4_DE-1.52.4-alpha/vivi-music-de.install"},{"name":"VIVIMusic-6.0.6.4_DE-1.52.4-arm64.dmg","s