OH/vivi-music`, now a read-only mirror) to `PiBOH/vivi-music-de` and the 80 issues were transferred in their original order, so each of them has a new number there: every `#N` in this changelog, in `TODO.md`, in `AGENTS.md` and in the code comments was rewritten to that number, and every issue URL was pointed at `PiBOH/vivi-music-de`. The old fork URLs would still redirect, but a bare `#N` would have silently landed on a different issue.\n\n### Commits\n- v6.0.6.4_DE-1.52.4-alpha: point every issue reference at the official numbering\n---\nThis release was built automatically from commit `17577ff0f2a34df8b5b9e06ff043ef42caefc85b`.\n"},{"tag_name":"6.0.6.4_DE-1.52.3-alpha","name":"Vivi Music 6.0.6.4_DE 1.52.3","published_at":"2026-09-20T15:49:40Z","prerelease":true,"draft":false,"html_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/tag/6.0.6.4_DE-1.52.3-alpha","assets":[{"name":"innosetup.log","size":49089,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.4_DE-1.52.3-alpha/innosetup.log"},{"name":"INSTALL-GUIDE.md","size":9247,"download_count":1,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.4_DE-1.52.3-alpha/INSTALL-GUIDE.md"},{"name":"PKGBUILD","size":1751,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.4_DE-1.52.3-alpha/PKGBUILD"},{"name":"SRCINFO","size":618,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.4_DE-1.52.3-alpha/SRCINFO"},{"name":"VIVIMusic-6.0.6.4_DE-1.52.3-arm64.dmg","size":153094622,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.4_DE-1.52.3-alpha/VIVIMusic-6.0.6.4_DE-1.52.3-arm64.dmg"},{"name":"VIVIMusic-6.0.6.4_DE-1.52.3-arm64.pkg","size":147916451,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.4_DE-1.52.3-alpha/VIVIMu